==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{onomatopoeic|ru}}. Related to {{cog|bg|хвъ́рля}}, {{cog|mk|фрла}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|швыря́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-швырять.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|швыря́ть|impf|pf=швырну́ть<q:semelfactive>|vn=швыря́ние|vadj=швыря́тельный}}

# to [[toss]], to [[hurl]], to [[throw]], to [[chuck]]
# {{lb|ru|by extension}} to put things in disorder, to not where they belong (e.g. clothing)
# to [[fling]] (money)

